Zem
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
FRUIS 0 FACE_LAST
FRUIS 9 FACE_LAST
FRUIS 9 FACE_LAST
FRUIS 9 FACE_LAST
FRUIS 9 FACE_LAST
